        "authorName": "Gnejusz Pompejusz",
        "name": {
          "en-US": "Tomos"
        },
        "summary": {
          "en-US": "Tomos is an unofficial client for the Polish Librus Synergia platform"
        },
        "description": {
          "en-US": "<p>\nTomos is an unofficial client for the Polish Librus Synergia platform, built with Flutter to bring clarity to grades, messages, attendance, homework, and school information for students and parents.\n</p>\n\n<p>\nTomos is not affiliated with Librus. It is actively developed and may contain bugs or visual differences between screens as features and design evolve.\n</p>\n\n<p><b>Features:</b></p>\n<ul>\n  <li><b>Unified Feed &amp; Calendar</b>: Weekly and daily schedule views, school events, holidays, teacher absences, and substitutions.</li>\n  <li><b>Grades</b>: View numeric and descriptive grades with weights, skills, categories, and subject grouping.</li>\n  <li><b>Attendance &amp; Justifications</b>: Attendance statistics with custom grouping rules and absence justifications.</li>\n  <li><b>Homework &amp; Trips</b>: Track assignments, upcoming school trips, and school year milestones.</li>\n  <li><b>Messaging</b>: Read, send, and organize messages with tags, drafts, and attachments.</li>\n  <li><b>Accounts, Security &amp; Theming</b>: Multiple user accounts, encrypted credential storage, auto-login, and customizable themes.</li>\n</ul>\n"
        },
